    <title>Road Less Traveled</title>
    <sub-title>Ireland</sub-title>
    <desc>A nation of gregarious people that loves their libations  a fantastic whiskey tasting at Teeling in Dublin makes Jonathan wonder, what happened to Irish whiskey? How did it lose the crown to Scotland? To find out, he gets an adventure bike and charts course on a new mission to find out.</desc>
